BT 1 0 0 1 0 56 Tm /F1 9 Tf 13 TL (Testing covered core user journeys in the Realbugz practice application. Most observed functions behaved as expected,) Tj T* (including product search, sorting, filtering, cart calculations, checkout required-field validation, order cancellation, and) Tj T* (out-of-stock restrictions. The strongest issue observed was that checkout accepted a clearly nonsensical delivery) Tj T* (address and created an order. A form-validation display inconsistency and repeat-submission behavior were also) Tj T* (observed; the latter requires backend verification before it can be called a confirmed duplicate-record defect.) Tj T* ET
